<title>CANADA: Canada to hold 5 bond auctions in Q3 1997.</title>
<headline>Canada to hold 5 bond auctions in Q3 1997.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada said it will hold five bond auctions, including one real return issue, in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The first auction, of 30-year bonds, will be on July 23, with details to be released on July 17.</p>
<p>Further details follow.</p>
<p> Term     Auction date   Details    Dated    Amt Maturing</p>
<p> 30-year     July 23	July 17    Aug 1	    nil</p>
<p> 10-year	Aug 6	 July 31    Aug 15	   nil</p>
<p>  5-year	Aug 27	 Aug 21   Sept 2	    nil</p>
<p> RRB	   Sept 3	  Aug 28   Sept 8	    nil</p>
<p>  2-year     Sept 10	Sept 4    Sept 15    C$5.4 bln</p>
<p>The real return bond (RRB) is auctioned on a single-price format.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
